{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2023-01-31 16:43:00', 'title': 'SOCALGAS DECLARES PREFERRED DIVIDENDS', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES , JAN. 31, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA GAS CO. (SOCALGAS) HAS DECLARED REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDENDS FOR THE PREFERRED SERIES STOCK OF THE COMPANY AS FOLLOWS: SOCALGAS: PREFERRED STOCK \xa0$0.375 PER SHARE PREFERRED STOCK, SERIES A \xa0$0.375 PER SHARE THE DIVIDENDS ARE PAYABLE ON APRIL 15, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON MARCH 10, 2023. ABOUT SOCALGAS HEADQUARTERED IN\u202fLOS ANGELES,\u202fSOCALGAS®\u202fIS THE\u202fLARGEST GAS DISTRIBUTION UTILITY\u202fIN\u202fTHE\u202fUNITED STATES.'}